            <div xml:id="m-9b3ce79c-9af9-4946-9068-11c1973d6a37">
              <lg xml:id="m-ce935579-51f4-4aa3-8853-4f306672607b">
                <l xml:id="m-a4344ac9-50a0-42c4-9669-4415217c23a7" facs="#m-3e9db551-2585-4680-b9bf-5013e2c85768" label="text-like">The Mass of the day.</l><l xml:id="m-76e9dcf3-abd8-4102-92b8-ff3983524ad0" facs="#m-ee21dd41-c031-4968-8842-c19d02cea481" label="ambiguous">409</l><l xml:id="m-06880b22-487b-407d-a278-6951ef3d6178" facs="#m-a24004fc-c29a-4cfc-9094-fe0b223e3350" label="lyrics-like">saéculi: virga aequitátis, virga regni! mánuum tuárum sunt caeli. Ipsi</l><l xml:id="m-9f153c60-96a3-4eea-9e66-255bb82ed4b3" facs="#m-5238a291-d97d-4651-8612-cc631ba88f79" label="ambiguous">tui. Dilexisti justitiam, et odisti ini¬</l><l xml:id="m-65357845-c1ef-4bca-bb66-099237e5bfe2" facs="#m-385c8ea3-02df-49ac-ae4e-46c3357d1e37" label="lyrics-like">peribunt, tu autem permanébis, et</l><l xml:id="m-c2d0f1dd-270a-4f9a-90c6-1209f97c122f" facs="#m-5e399508-8676-49fd-b911-878b336f73c5" label="lyrics-like">quitátem : proptérea unxit te Deus,</l><l xml:id="m-4c622e10-a10c-4648-9664-d010e5177f36" facs="#m-dee3411c-2a1d-4247-a7de-249a521da111" label="lyrics-like">omnes ut vestiméntum veteráscent:</l><l xml:id="m-9c20c30c-7722-4c99-92f1-051e45b92d80" facs="#m-d64396fa-a9a7-4c18-895f-ac67289a6ec2" label="lyrics-like">Deus tuus, óleo exsultatiónis prae</l><l xml:id="m-46e50a00-eb0a-4bc8-a8ce-551559168a3b" facs="#m-5bf0746e-ae4d-48a1-b64f-2a06b3dca943" label="lyrics-like">et velut amíctum mutábis eos, et</l><l xml:id="m-88322184-6d5a-4c73-af16-8911e9df829e" facs="#m-cd17799d-6ae6-4981-8a88-6095d584b7a6" label="ambiguous">particspibus tuis. Et :Tu in principio,</l><l xml:id="m-f94441d9-ccf8-406d-b542-f183f657390a" facs="#m-ead47126-173a-4394-a232-c5b11eaa4715" label="lyrics-like">mutabúntur: tu autem idem ipse</l><l xml:id="m-d31575ae-d6c1-480b-ac6c-156d39b99bab" facs="#m-ff4c2e0e-840d-49cb-afa2-732ee1668fad" label="lyrics-like">Dómine, terram fundásti : et ópera les, et anni tui non deficient.</l><l xml:id="m-fbb63419-9ec1-4dcb-94df-7133c6e3b23d" facs="#m-42c72712-0bfc-487e-b517-c8b3f5f050be" label="ambiguous">Grad.</l><l xml:id="m-533527a9-7d43-4e29-9a89-5de9c29f2c45" facs="#m-3c3d9ea0-d16e-4a34-818f-b31d25d78300" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-f2c9deeb-1498-4d7c-9006-5e32a6baf320" facs="#m-75d8a219-cc3c-4624-9ea5-98201637d597" label="lyrics-like">Idérunt 6- mnes</l><l xml:id="m-76d78149-4b30-4d2f-a526-7a35fe3d944e" facs="#m-755e8dee-7e99-4768-bc6a-80368789ed08" label="lyrics-like">fínes tér¬ rae</l><l xml:id="m-ff925c94-b156-4531-be11-1761b5f86281" facs="#m-f679ec0a-105e-4dbb-a5b8-2ed8a03b8c5e" label="ambiguous">sa¬</l><l xml:id="m-e68bdaa2-fb3b-4882-9f57-3e6db4e36b2b" facs="#m-73f8ceb4-1df5-451f-8de7-0cf9055fd5a8" label="lyrics-like">lu-tá-re Dé¬ i nóstri:</l><l xml:id="m-c8fa8b36-119b-482c-9605-b3d7361f5016" facs="#m-9b3424c4-3d0a-4a37-9e21-bc281138741d" label="lyrics-like">jubi-lá-te Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-26e34529-94b5-4425-aea9-8eea8691d253" facs="#m-64e1483e-6794-415b-9a48-0c1c469130f5" label="ambiguous">o</l><l xml:id="m-238fb62c-9717-4d82-b216-0dec930de21a" facs="#m-5e10adce-9b22-4266-aeaf-7e8e5a5bdf5d" label="lyrics-like">W. Nó-tum fé-cit Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-1df8714f-0282-47ad-af7f-4842adc61b3d" facs="#m-c7427881-404a-4987-b731-f6df59ebf68f" label="lyrics-like">6́- mnis</l><l xml:id="m-b14b704b-6863-44ae-ab91-96344a45dc46" facs="#m-cfee794f-a9e8-4846-92f9-17f0f0bea37c" label="lyrics-like">tér-ra.</l><l xml:id="m-a244da04-385a-434a-83cd-4a53eb41b299" facs="#m-eae02a59-b80b-4afd-b3d0-7fb0957fd503" label="ambiguous">mi-nus sa-lu¬</l><l xml:id="m-2478a197-e56e-4253-81ec-011845212c1c" facs="#m-65bb3e82-38ac-4afc-ae83-3c57de495e5a" label="lyrics-like">tá¬ re sú¬ um : ante conspéctum génti- um re¬</l><l xml:id="m-e468d6f0-b99d-4a9e-bc22-4c9ce82a03f1" facs="#m-f6ccc549-3cb0-4e86-803f-445ac1cd6519" label="lyrics-like">vit “ justí¬</l><l xml:id="m-5d62ea15-c61e-4fbd-91ec-68053b5ba500" facs="#m-cca7e268-2192-4f04-82fe-194293a9bfb0" label="lyrics-like">ti- am sú-am.</l><l xml:id="m-99dd3f80-6015-4bf8-9507-55b5a83476eb" facs="#m-ee5851a8-21a8-404d-92e7-f05f5605b2d1" label="lyrics-like">ve-lá¬</l><l xml:id="m-48a8b298-3139-4db2-9d27-9884f07613c5" facs="#m-01f6fcfc-cda4-40e7-8780-22b68031ea43" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-93499c84-4b06-44e1-82d7-c68347d963af" facs="#m-7dcec092-27fb-492f-9b37-f62e0ab1b34a" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-47161a62-78c2-4389-a696-cd92eb15ac94" facs="#m-f335adc7-da41-4f9b-930e-44b806adc352" label="ambiguous">V. Di¬</l><l xml:id="m-bccd7a1e-cd07-4647-b1b0-578598a88696" facs="#m-f1544cc0-5547-49b9-9809-066e0bfc91d6" label="lyrics-like">Lle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-10f1407a-4bd3-425f-9f85-e3118ebcd23b" facs="#m-69bc0ea2-9251-4e44-9db7-a98f173d558d" label="ambiguous">ij</l><l xml:id="m-a3b6300b-3e84-424e-9068-c91c34355cc3" facs="#m-4d01f6a9-253d-477a-97a8-47c22c78235f" label="ambiguous">bis:</l><l xml:id="m-3b8689c5-a2e2-4522-899b-d9bd5eae98cc" facs="#m-aecf18e6-e498-415d-adec-7d4b682a76f4" label="lyrics-like">sancti-ficátus illúxit nó¬</l><l xml:id="m-e6ddbf5b-d56b-436c-82b7-149cc6ddacf4" facs="#m-ab5f4cc1-9bbe-4794-b451-f1bee6234878" label="ambiguous">es</l><l xml:id="m-86d10bd7-c1a3-4504-a629-cd6704fc1843" facs="#m-2ae54c05-7e7b-4180-b2fb-5b5bcbb54d2e" label="lyrics-like">Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-9a7001f6-e59e-462b-81ff-142ec27d22fd" facs="#m-b3bf7572-ef41-4f0d-be99-ce32ea4befab" label="lyrics-like">ní-te géntes, et adorá-te</l><l xml:id="m-0952fdcd-c552-4147-8121-8b268fed4428" facs="#m-25352149-abfe-4c3c-96fa-dc058e69676d" label="ambiguous">ve¬</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
